  "text": "Hi Professor Alvarez — following up on our hallway chat. Could we put the 30-minute meeting on Wednesday at 10:00am? I know your calendar still shows the faculty senate meeting at that hour; you mentioned it's cancelled this week and you're free then. If that still works, would you add it to your calendar (or tell me and I'll send an invite)? Happy to shift if something has come up.",
